WEBVTT

00:00:01.190 --> 00:00:03.330
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:06.310
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:13.050
It's just about time for the super duper huge annual event to decide the Academy's top idol.

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:15.160
The Starlight Queen Cup is upon us!

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:20.660
Mizuki-san has held the title of Starlight Queen for the past two years running.

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:27.170
Mizuki-san became an idol after her heart was captured by the now-defunct legendary idol group Masquerade.

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:31.270
We received special training from Johnny-sensei, who was in charge of Masquerade's choreography,

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:33.660
and got a huge power up!

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:37.430
We have to climb to greater heights so that we can catch up to Mizuki-san! {"gotta" is a little too informal for a sentence that has "greater heights", I think}

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:44.040
Saying it's not gonna help, but I'm just so nervous.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.470
Same here.

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:54.180
If you keep on whining like that,

00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:56.430
you two are going to be mistaken for an ambulance.

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:58.510
Ran-san, quite clever of you.

00:00:58.510 --> 00:00:59.580
Quite.

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:02.240
Though it's not like I'm not a little anxious myself.

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:06.160
Only a couple more days until the Starlight Queen Cup starts.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:07.460
Oh, I almost forgot.

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:11.250
Mizuki-san's new commercial went live today.

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:14.580
A stardust wink and a special appeal!

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:16.800
Mizuki's Moon Light Mascara! {Moonlight?} {maybe it's light mascara affiliated with the moon}

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:19.900
Mizuki-san's cute as always.

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:24.510
She really is.

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:29.400
Even though she's much busier than any of us, there's not a hint of exhaustion on her face.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:31.710
She's the unrivaled idol of idols!

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:32.610
Yeah!

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:38.680
You have a commercial shoot tomorrow.

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:41.470
I'll come back in a couple hours to pick you up at four. {literally a couple... wow}

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:43.330
Good job working so late.

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:46.290
Same to you, Honoka-san.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:51.750
Mizuki.

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:54.760
I know you've been swamped with work recently. How are you holding up?

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:58.130
Don't you already know my answer?

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:01.150
It's what you always say:

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:05.100
"I'm fine. Even if I'm not, I'll make it so."

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:06.770
Correct.

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:09.150
That's our Kanzaki Mizuki.

00:02:09.490 --> 00:02:11.000
Good night.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.870
Try to get some sleep.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.420
Why are we sneaking around like this?

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:14.100
Aren't you curious?

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:17.250
I wanna know what kind of idol Headmistress Orihime was.

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:19.440
I'm so so curious I can't even contain myself!

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:25.320
Our headmistress was the one and only Hime-chan from the legendary idol unit Masquerade.

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:27.670
I know, but still...

00:04:27.670 --> 00:04:31.090
Even Mizuki-san admired them.

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:35.410
I know that too, but do we really need to hide?

00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:36.690
I guess not.

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:37.840
Right?

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:42.340
But staying in the shadows makes it feel like we'll learn the bare naked truth!

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:46.720
My idol professor blood is boiling with excitement!

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:54.100
<i>Is someone stalking me?</i>

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:55.760
Aoi!

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:57.230
You girls.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:02.610
You want to know what kind of idol I was?

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:05.650
Then you could have just come and asked me directly.

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:07.110
Y-Yeah, you're right.

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:11.540
Unfortunately, I have an appointment to make momentarily.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:12.620
So instead of telling you...

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.140
What's that?

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:17.250
This is the key to the Masquerade reference room in the library.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:18.910
We normally keep it locked.

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.760
The Masquerade reference room!

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:27.390
Go and research to your hearts' content. 
It's full of information you can't find online.

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:30.240
Thank you very much.

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:33.600
I bet it's overflowing with materials!

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.520
I can see you imagining a mountain of treasure.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:36.020
Huh?

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.020
Mizuki-san?

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:44.910
Hey, good afternoon. {morning?}

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:46.390
Good afternoon.

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:48.590
It's Mizuki.

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:49.870
Come in.

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:51.530
Thank you.

00:05:53.590 --> 00:05:56.410
Don't you think Mizuki-san looked a bit tired?

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:58.350
And yet she gave a perfect smile in an instant.

00:05:58.350 --> 00:05:59.750
That's a pro for you.

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:10.050
This is the Masquerade reference room! {why is it so clean}

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:15.690
It's full to bursting with overflowing treasure!

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:17.490
What an incredible number of trophies.

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:19.520
I've never seen any of this stuff before.

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:24.900
Those three should be brushing up on their Masquerade history in the reference room about now.

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:29.030
Mizuki, how are you handling the busy schedule you have right now?

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:33.700
It's not a problem. A busy idol is a happy idol.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:36.830
Yes, I remember the days when I thought the same way.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:40.070
I'm overjoyed to hear you say that.

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:44.340
I look up to you and Miya-san even now.

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:48.840
"Masquerade was an idol unit formed by Hime and Miya.

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:51.810
Their influence and popularity once enraptured the nation."

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:54.880
I wonder why they wore masks though.

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:56.850
Hime—that is, Headmistress Orihime,

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:59.850
seems to have been next in line to inherit her father's business.

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:03.300
But because of her strong desire to become an idol,

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:06.790
she hid her face in order to deceive her parents and friends

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:09.190
and took an idol talent search audition.

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:12.870
She blew out the competition, and thus Masquerade was formed.

00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:16.270
Their popularity immediately skyrocketed.

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:21.170
Both CD sales and their tour attendance rate broke national records and they became a household name.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:22.250
Amazing!

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:26.810
Back then, I wanted to walk a path that was mine alone,

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:29.010
not one my parents chose for me.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:32.990
No matter how busy I was, or how tough the going went,

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:34.530
I burned with the flames of passion.

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:37.260
I completely understand; I'm the same way.

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:40.970
But don't you think there's something off?

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:41.640
Like what?

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:45.860
There may be plenty of information on Hime, 
but the record books are nearly blank on Miya.

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:46.750
Right.

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:48.280
Oh, that is strange.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:53.910
After Masquerade disbanded, all traces of Miya disappeared from the public.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:59.790
She may have had a secret she didn't want to get revealed in an interview or something.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:01.180
Definitely possible.

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:03.420
The truth is clouded in mystery.

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:06.370
I wonder what happened to Miya-chan.

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:09.520
Could you tell me what Miya-san is doing right now?

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:15.020
I can't tell anybody—not even you.

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:17.680
It was Miya's choice to keep her secrets hidden.

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:19.810
That makes sense.

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:24.940
We decided to break Masquerade up 
at the height of our popularity.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:28.390
It was right around the time I got an offer to become this school's headmistress.

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:31.890
Miya decided to take a completely different path.

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:34.570
You must have been filled with conflicting emotions.

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:38.330
Yes, especially with those concerning our fans.

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:42.150
But we had already made the decision to disband together.

00:08:42.150 --> 00:08:45.260
I made a promise to Miya back then:

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:50.050
That I would do everything in my power to turn Starlight Academy into a top-class idol school.

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:55.590
That's why the Starlight Queen Cup absolutely must be as intense as possible.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:56.720
Understood.

00:08:56.720 --> 00:09:01.870
By showcasing the spirited competition between the eight of us to the world,

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:05.100
we can help shine the spotlight upon every other idol in our school.

00:09:05.430 --> 00:09:06.780
I expect no less.

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:09.500
Everything begins tomorrow.

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:13.940
You, the current Queen, will perform the opening act.

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:15.990
It'll be broadcast live nationwide.

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:18.940
I will burn brilliantly for you.

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:22.260
I learned so much!

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:25.370
Masquerade really was as amazing as they say.

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:26.410
Yeah!

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:30.540
Okay, in preparation to become idols as incredible as Masquerade,

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:32.340
let's go pray!

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:34.130
Pray where?

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:41.560
May my performance for the Starlight Queen Cup go well.

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:43.310
So you decided to pray to...

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:46.240
the statue of Masquerade?

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:47.190
Not a bad idea.

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:51.860
In some respects, Masquerade were like the goddesses of idols.

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:53.490
Should we make an offering?

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:55.340
I'm not expecting that to help.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:10:01.570
It's really too bad that we were never able to see Masquerade perform live.

00:10:01.570 --> 00:10:02.510
Yeah.

00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:04.580
May good fortune befall us.

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:05.920
Goodbye.

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:12.960
Mizuki? Are you okay?

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:15.590
Yes, I'm fine.

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:18.590
Mizuki.

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:20.590
Don't push your limits too hard.

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:23.430
I... will break those limits.

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:29.660
The title of Starlight Queen is too important not to.

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:50.420
Good, that's a wrap.

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:53.980
Thank you very much.

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:03.180
I need to keep hanging in there.

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:07.940
I... will break those limits.

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:27.450
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:29.380
It's almost time...

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:33.080
The Starlight Queen Cup...

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:34.380
...starts tomorrow!

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:36.730
I'm gonna keep...

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:38.200
...trying har—

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:41.760
Nice effort, Otome-sama!

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:45.930
Yurika-tan, you have it easy.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:49.640
Of course, it's thanks to my six hundred years of vampiric effort.

00:11:50.110 --> 00:11:53.090
Hello, this is Toudou. I'd like the usual.

00:11:53.090 --> 00:11:56.320
Delivery, and please make it with extra garlic.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:12:01.400
Th-That's right. I heard it's better to have more garlic before a big concert.

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:05.450
It's Raichi! It's Raichi!

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:05.450
Oh, a call from Raichi.

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:10.520
Go give it your best shot, Aoi-neesan!

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:12.290
You too, Ran-san, Onee-chan!

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:16.060
Don't you think you're being a bit <i>too</i> nice to Aoi there?

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:17.850
I didn't mean to...

00:12:18.560 --> 00:12:19.170
Really!

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:22.590
But I seriously can't wait until tomorrow. Right, Mom?

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:23.180
Yep!

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:26.050
I'm really looking forward to it.

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:27.820
Thanks!

00:12:27.820 --> 00:12:30.810
I've still got my rice scoop here as my good luck charm.

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:31.930
Where were you keeping that?

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:33.890
It never leaves my side.

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:36.940
I've been carrying it as my charm ever since I became an idol.

00:12:37.390 --> 00:12:40.190
We'll take that scoop and turn it into a mic! {changed from first episode}

00:12:40.550 --> 00:12:43.700
Now take that scoop, and make it a mic!

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:49.630
Though if you think about it, we rarely use 
microphones up on the Aikatsu Illusion Stage.

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:51.200
Don't sweat the small stuff.

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:53.580
Anyway, all of you!

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:55.080
Go give it your all!

00:12:58.180 --> 00:13:00.630
I'll come to get you tomorrow morning at six.

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:01.210
Okay.

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:02.970
Have a good night.

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:06.070
I won't ask if you're okay,

00:13:06.070 --> 00:13:08.010
but tell me when you've hit your limit.

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:10.390
Yeah, I will.

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:24.180
Ichigo? {This is important on like at least three different levels}

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:25.900
Mizuki-san?

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:28.550
A rice scoop in the middle of the night...

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:31.080
I assume you're not holding that because you're hungry.

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:34.910
This is my good luck charm.

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:38.540
Are you getting nervous about the Starlight Queen Cup?

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:42.540
I am, but for some reason I feel like it'll all be okay.

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:43.300
Why?

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:46.850
The reason I decided to turn my scoop into a mic

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:49.690
was because I wanted to become more like you.

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:52.310
Those feelings haven't changed.

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:57.880
I know I'll be able to turn these feelings of admiration into strength and put on an enjoyable concert.

00:13:57.880 --> 00:13:58.810
I'm sure of it.

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:01.630
Feelings of admiration...

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:04.070
Let's have fun out there.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:05.570
Yeah!

00:14:05.890 --> 00:14:07.040
Good night.

00:14:09.590 --> 00:14:10.820
Um...

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:15.080
Mizuki-san, you seem really tired lately...

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:20.080
Don't worry, I have those feelings too.

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:31.670
<i>I've always gotten by 
by overcoming one hurdle at a time.</i>

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:35.600
<i>All I need to focus on is performing well on stage tomorrow.</i>

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:38.100
<i>Ichigo was exactly right.</i>

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:40.980
<i>Admiration gives us strength.</i>

00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:45.130
<i>Even when I feel lost and unsure of what to do,</i>

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:47.050
<i>even when I can no longer move,</i>

00:14:47.050 --> 00:14:51.260
<i>Masquerade's shining light fills me with strength.</i>

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:55.020
<i>I want to keep chasing after them as the Starlight Queen.</i>

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:56.620
<i>Masquerade...</i>

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:08.380
The curtain is about to rise on the long awaited Starlight Queen Cup.

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:12.390
This year will begin with Kanzaki Mizuki's anniversary concert!

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:13.680
I'm so excited!

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:14.340
Me too.

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:16.010
I wonder what she'll sing.

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:21.810
Mizuki.

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.740
Could you let me go in alone so that I can focus better?

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:29.280
Sure, this is how you've always been, after all.

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:49.420
<i>Today won't be any different.</i>

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:56.220
<i>I can do this. I have to do this!</i>

00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:12.600
<i>No... why now?</i>

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:16.030
<i>Sorry...</i>

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:23.720
Mizuki...

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:25.540
Mizuki-chan...

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:31.210
Leave the rest to us.

00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:32.610
You did well.

00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:35.510
I've always been watching your wonderful expressions from afar.

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:39.430
Rest easy.

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:44.020
This was entirely my fault.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:47.310
Mizuki is always pushing herself to the very edge.

00:16:48.050 --> 00:16:51.400
Taking care of one's health is a vital part of being an idol.

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.660
She just hit her limit...

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:56.030
Not to worry. I don't mind lending a hand.

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:59.080
Thank you, Miya. And sorry.

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:03.300
I know better than anybody else

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:05.170
just how much you care for Starlight Academy.

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:09.920
Not only are we out of practice, but we haven't even rehearsed.

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:13.290
Not a problem so long as we believe in ourselves,

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:17.590
and so long as I'm standing on your left like I always was.

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:13.070
I have just been informed of an 
unprecedented announcement.

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:17.120
Our originally scheduled opening act for the Starlight Queen Cup will be changed.

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:19.490
Prepare yourselves to be graced by this unbelievable,

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:21.510
unexpected, glorious rebirth!

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:24.230
The legendary Masquerade!

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:27.230
Masquerade?!

00:18:27.230 --> 00:18:29.080
But why, how, when, where?

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:22.990
Incredible! This concert will definitely become a legend!

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:27.520
We just witnessed the birth of an unbelievable event in the history of idols!

00:20:27.520 --> 00:20:30.440
They were so much more wonderful than the videos we saw.

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:30.870
Yeah!

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:34.210
Even with their masks, they were cute and fun—

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:35.750
Their expressions shone through!

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:41.220
You may have tried just a bit too hard this time.

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:44.510
Trying too hard doesn't even count as an excuse.

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:45.640
Mizuki...

00:20:46.560 --> 00:20:48.610
It's time for me to take the stage.

00:20:48.610 --> 00:20:51.140
That's ridiculous! You need to stay in bed.

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:55.520
Admiration brings strength that falters in no circumstance. {"Admiration becomes strength that cannot be changed (i.e. affected/lessened) by anything", reword as you see fit}

00:20:55.930 --> 00:20:59.270
And I just received a huge burst of strength!

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:09.160
Masquerade and Mizuki-san made this an amazing opening concert!

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:12.020
Good job out there.

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:13.330
You too.

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:15.290
Thanks so much, Miya.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:17.670
I had a lot of fun out there myself.

00:21:21.290 --> 00:21:23.550
I think it's about time, don't you?

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:33.810
Wait up a minute! Do you really think it's alright to just waltz up to Masquerade like this?

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:36.010
Then you want to give up?

00:21:36.010 --> 00:21:38.080
Not a chance.

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:40.610
It's not like we've never talked to Headmistress Orihime before.

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:42.350
That's a completely different thing.

00:21:45.480 --> 00:21:47.080
Good job on stage.

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:47.700
Thanks.

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:50.450
Hoshimiya, Miya wants to see you in the dressing room.

00:21:55.700 --> 00:21:57.080
Please excuse me.

00:21:59.310 --> 00:22:00.820
That was a wonderful concert.

00:22:00.820 --> 00:22:03.510
Headmistress Orihime sent me here.

00:22:04.770 --> 00:22:07.800
There's something I'd like to talk about. Could you come closer?

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:08.690
Yes.

00:22:11.400 --> 00:22:12.470
I'd like to say...

00:22:12.860 --> 00:22:17.360
That I've turned my mic into a scoop.

00:22:18.840 --> 00:22:20.110
Mama?!

00:23:55.690 --> 00:23:57.620
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.510 --> 00:24:01.700
A "masquerade" is a ball you wear a mask to.

00:24:01.700 --> 00:24:04.970
It's an old form of dance party that used to be held in the West.

00:24:04.970 --> 00:24:06.590
It's a pretty exciting event.

00:24:07.300 --> 00:24:09.760
Eyes can speak as much as mouths.

00:24:10.590 --> 00:24:13.280
Is my mom really part of<i> the </i>Masquerade?

00:24:13.280 --> 00:24:14.910
Sorry for the surprise.

00:24:14.910 --> 00:24:16.970
Tomorrow let's do Aikatsu together!

00:24:18.210 --> 00:24:19.930
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:19.930 --> 00:24:21.590
Wake up my music.

00:24:21.590 --> 00:24:25.490
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
